<title>ITALY: Italy bond futures contract hits new record high.</title>
<headline>Italy bond futures contract hits new record high.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's September BTP futures contract hit a new record high of 135.89 in early afternoon on Monday.</p>
<p>The previous record high was 135.84 reached on Friday July 4. Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
